"Public Output" means a publicly accessible product, website, service,
publication, report, presentation, or other work that materially uses the
Software or a substantial portion of its functionality. Merely using an output
created by an unmodified, general-purpose tool does not by itself make that
output a Public Output.

"Attribution" means a reasonable and visible notice containing all of:

  (a) the name "Quortol";
  (b) the credit "Quortol contributors";
  (c) https://github.com/abhijeetdtu/quortol; and
  (d) a link to, or an included copy of, this license.

"Content" means original documentation, writing, datasets, images, audio,
video, and other non-software works identified in CONTENT-LICENSE.md.

"Third-Party Materials" means material for which copyright or other rights are
